{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "735d9e2af58c80dc9c3c1114d1449e08b10715fb29d249308c214a974cefad1a", "ja": "（今日は可奈と動物番組のオーディションに来ている。\n『芸能人のペット紹介』コーナーの出演枠だ！）", "zh": "（今天和可奈一起来参加动物节目的试镜。是出演“艺人宠物介绍”环节的机会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "49e51275474f9ba3b2811bdcbee0e2673101ace4183b7a01180425ff2bf36910", "ja": "（小さなコーナーだけど、番組はゴールデン枠……\n合格すれば、大勢の人に見てもらえるはずだ！）", "zh": "（虽然只是个小环节，但节目可是黄金时段……要是通过了，应该就能让很多人看到她了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "2c315974c75219fa1d656162b1f679e42e9fa6d07544a9ee45218a325212e34d", "ja": "ららら～、オーディション～♪\n矢吹可奈、がんばります！", "zh": "啦啦啦～试镜～♪\n矢吹可奈，会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "294f019a9c69ce9c3bbe438d9b44f3826144cb87c767baa70a1e1ff876109b11", "ja": "はは、やる気だな！　今日のオーディションは、\n可奈本人と、ペットの動画が審査対象だからな。", "zh": "哈哈，干劲十足嘛！今天的试镜，评审对象可是可奈本人和宠物的视频哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7447439d3ec0265bcc1ce2ee1f8b7196aaac8d744a060fe6c7c2407d3a48844f", "ja": "ペットは、インコのけるちゃんだったな。\n動画は用意してきてくれてる……。", "zh": "宠物是虎皮鹦鹉小啾吧。\n视频也准备好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "715bc8540df667b04b368fe3ff3231c14cb5d200f65fe7aca220851d4ade0059", "ja": "ペットの、動画……？　えええ～っ！？\nそ、そうだったんですか！？", "zh": "宠物的视频……？诶诶诶～！？\n原、原来是这样啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "4c39f9b2008e9cc8b78fa508eb9a459223b64e03f050e4536e1242eb765de79a", "ja": "どうしよう……！　あの、私、勘違いしてて！\nその、けるちゃんを連れてきちゃったんですけど……。", "zh": "怎么办……！那个，我之前误会了！其实，我把小凯尔带来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "61a8b0a37483273aed9eaea2bfefbae756c9b1849f278be1dfed775ad9378a6b", "ja": "えっ！？　インコ自体を……？　そうか、\n大荷物だと思ったら、鳥かごだったのか……。", "zh": "咦！？是要把鹦鹉本身……？原来如此，我还以为是带了很多行李，没想到是鸟笼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "5187bc56e52ee2eb246244eb6d455c71e88251b939015c374da4b0b56bb48167", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい～。\nどうしましょう、{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "对、对不起～。\n这下该怎么办啊，{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "da4bfbd81756c39954568fa8ac0dbff7ab5ac4e9b7fdb24153861c3eab9112c8", "ja": "これは、さすがに予想外だったな……。\nとりあえず、番組スタッフさんに相談してみよう。", "zh": "这还真是出乎意料啊……  \n总之，先去和节目工作人员商量一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1010_staff", "source_sha256": "8fae859f8df65ffb80c56a4539dfd6176eb6f3c6511de4dce5e1f35bf27ccd8d", "ja": "持ち込みでも大丈夫ですよ。動画は、\n持ち込みが難しいペットのための措置なので。", "zh": "带过来也没关系。视频是为不方便带来的宠物准备的措施。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3af6697a4c141ef0aaf4c8e89c8b075944df5bf549f0576871638de1ad123ab", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか？\nよかったぁ……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊？\n太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1012_staff", "source_sha256": "1c5e87c1c4ce5fd8dab3cbb55b45a500ea6845a4d1fb3c308b3871d33eca2d53", "ja": "ただ、インコだと絵面的にちょっと弱いかもなぁ……。\nおっと、電話だ。失礼しますね。", "zh": "不过，要是鹦鹉的话，画面效果可能稍微差了点……。\n哎呀，电话来了。失陪一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "4d84ad7186405f6978224ae29f39ac0c109e44f2fe2352f4298b1f38d752473a", "ja": "よ、弱い……。うう……。", "zh": "好、好弱……呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a886b6e4716b16f8ee9607422cfd32fc3415153aa41ab6b177479bf349d0f4e6", "ja": "可奈、気にせずいこう。けるちゃんを直接見て\nもらえるんだ、逆にチャンスだと考えよう！", "zh": "可奈，别放在心上，继续吧。能让大家直接看到小Keru，\n反过来想想，这可是个机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "b4af4a4392cade84f595425e3dd091d8eb019ca76814cf5a5f7752b2d5b49e1a", "ja": "そ、そうですよね！　せっかく本物が\nいるんですから、たくさんアピールしなくちゃ！", "zh": "对、对啊！难得本人就在这里，一定要好好展示自己才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "6f0934557c7bb2a464d2429ad8fd68034e52adc8efe0f2a8eeabcb575e841f11", "ja": "あっ……でも別に、けるちゃん、\nすごい特技があるわけじゃないんですよね……。", "zh": "啊……不过，ける也没有什么特别厉害的特长啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4b3fa68d06fce6864df03f29bb3b478db71932491c4c9f58434dbfdb2206f5c0", "ja": "そうか、特技はなしか。\nそうなると、どうやってアピールするか……うーん。", "zh": "这样啊，没有什么特长吗。\n这样的话，要怎么展现自己呢……嗯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "a62177132fda7a3acd6d1028b0f5eec64734d81e6d554fc0e5beb173475b7dc7", "ja": "あの、私、何かないか考えてみます！\n落ち込んでても、始まらないですもんね！", "zh": "那个，我来想想看有没有什么能用的！\n就算情绪低落，也无济于事嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c0e23242d989eb34a5b75a63a80d59beeb1195fd128a743e77d9cbc897af995", "ja": "困ったな～、けるちゃん～♪\nだってもう目の前だ、オーディション～♪", "zh": "好苦恼呀～，小可～♪\n因为试镜～，已经就在眼前啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "fca08233360484ddb847d04efda636ac36f44c71c709a107df60c8e5d38113f5", "ja": "でもでも～、やってやるぞ～♪\n特技はないけど～、ゴーゴゴ～♪", "zh": "可是可是～我会加油的～♪\n虽然没有什么特长～冲啊冲啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1021_keruchan", "source_sha256": "ad9ed82a01c7166eb90332d8fed50220a8a7acb28cb02f4ce4ca963891ecb05a", "ja": "トクギハナイケド～、ゴーゴゴ～♪", "zh": "虽然没有什么特长～，冲冲冲～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "032876c52b7e8c10c4902aa695b3ee27324f0114af878b363c2c5a93db7c811b", "ja": "えっ！？　今の歌、可奈に\nそっくりだったけど……もしかして。", "zh": "诶！？刚才那首歌，和可奈唱得\n一模一样……难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "1f7567308df4d2332eabe874575c0188a6c5303a4bd1a91c410868bc047d5d4b", "ja": "はい！　今のはけるちゃんです♪", "zh": "是的！刚才唱的是可儿哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "36854d2c3e77f173c84648c1ff52ad70596107585cbb3f55dae92abbd5cd1b58", "ja": "私、家でもよく歌うから、覚えちゃったみたいで。\n私が歌うと、一緒に歌ってくれるようになったんです。", "zh": "我在家也经常唱歌，小可好像就这样记住了。\n我一唱，它就会跟着一起唱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1025_p", "source_sha256": "efe586724f37702f71f18da7c8c96cbd98581203c9cfcccd95df1107683ae1bf", "ja": "あるじゃないか、立派な特技が！\nよし、ここは可奈とけるちゃんの歌で勝負しよう！", "zh": "这不是有一项很棒的特长吗！\n好，就用可奈和可儿的歌来一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "92c7d883c1cb506560fa12f6861ef71a4b84f5b220cdb9665afbe7c3e9865706", "ja": "私と、けるちゃんの歌で……？", "zh": "我和小克鲁的歌……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "5a9a4b659c8203e6721f3eb19526c08b1e1dbe88b2b10facf0155ce902bf2a2c", "ja": "765プロダクションの矢吹可奈です！　インコの\nけるちゃんと一緒に、歌を歌います！　こほん。", "zh": "我是765艺能事务所的矢吹可奈！接下来要和鹦鹉\n凯露酱一起唱歌！咳哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "d10947cc6e16e1e7214cd9eba5d465838954068e10f35b82720e3e4517b8b72b", "ja": "いよいよ本番～♪　オーディション～♪\nちょとつも～しん♪　も～も～しん♪　はいどーぞ！", "zh": "终于要正式登台了～♪　试镜～♪\n勇往～直前♪　直～直前♪　请接招！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1029_keruchan", "source_sha256": "aa0225e5264077c21de9fd1dd17e0106b55e311946a70443013df8666fa62099", "ja": "チョトツモ～シン♪　モ～モ～シンッ♪\nハイドーゾ！", "zh": "猪突猛进～♪　猛～猛～进♪  \n来，请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "482ba2b6c23c281858f18ae61cb61d20027c8200ead27bd0d375ac5e3bd0beaf", "ja": "あっ、けるちゃん！\nそこはマネしなくていいの！", "zh": "啊，小可奈！\n那里不用学啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1031_keruchan", "source_sha256": "177da6c1ba815b2a9d5cd80fd0e686d459c82edde5b3e487f9501503c8262a02", "ja": "ソコハマネシナクテイイノ！", "zh": "那里不用学啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1032_shinsain", "source_sha256": "bf729523e668fa6377c0b7d7b8c4a34268bd7393cff22e7371233f1bc6e64e4f", "ja": "くすくす……。\nとってもかわいらしいコンビね。", "zh": "嘻嘻……真是一对可爱的搭档呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8e177e89591e5b15c33244910301635d17133948b468ff6ad195e322127382a7", "ja": "（審査員方からの感触もよく、可奈とけるちゃんは\nオーディションで、見事合格をもぎ取った！）", "zh": "（评委们的反馈也很好，可奈和小克尔在试镜中漂亮地拿到了合格！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "cb999ca0d08dde585aa9ca8fcd6903d18090e8f6d2c7896439967273867ec2fc", "ja": "わ、私が合格……？\n本当にお仕事、もらえたんですか！？", "zh": "我、我合格了……？\n真的拿到这份工作了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "d19c28cd80af4434dabc321012dbbebcbfd71dfcd665157f3eaf6271b3d2f7c8", "ja": "やった～！！　アイドルのお仕事、ゲットだ～♪\nしかもしかも、けるちゃんと一緒だ～♪", "zh": "太好了～！！拿到偶像的工作啦～♪\n而且而且，还能和可儿酱一起～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1036_keruchan", "source_sha256": "be2855c95efa0f24c44eab356b1412f5581e87c033a555d53eb522d4d0162c3c", "ja": "イッショダ～♪", "zh": "一起呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "f4fe94dfa53bdacbcf93891789fb78d5578b9a7fe38611f79aaca9717c297575", "ja": "けるちゃん、{$P$}さん！\n本当に、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "Keru，{$P$}先生！\n真的非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_005_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "afcd5cdf708e76cea603fe066962b918d137eab473d6be8f327a2adf8d2ef50f", "ja": "ぐすっ……涙が出るほど、うれしいぞ～♪\nもっともっとがんばって、た～くさん、歌うぞ～♪", "zh": "抽泣……高兴得眼泪都要流出来了～♪\n我会更加更加努力，唱好多好多歌～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
